 <!--
   SLEUTH KIT AUTOPSY - LUCENE REGEX COMPATIBLE
   Fixed by Opus - Lucene regex rules:
   - NO \s \d \b \n \t (use explicit chars)
   - Use .* for substring matching (Lucene anchors by default)
   - Supported: . * + ? | () []
   - Character classes: [a-z] [0-9] [abc]
   - Escape special chars with backslash when literal
 -->

